## Security
Never commit: .env, passwords, tokens, keys, logs, database backups

## Task Completion Format
After completing a task, output:
```
## Summary: what was changed
## Files Changed: list
## Tests: results
## Git Status: clean/modified
## Next Steps: suggestions
```
